<h2>Step 7 — Vaccination entry — validity &amp; stamp</h2>
<label>Validity starts on <input type="date" name="entry_1_validity_starts_on" /></label>
<label>Validity ends on <input type="date" name="entry_1_validity_ends_on" /></label>
<label>
  <input type="checkbox" name="entry_1_validity_is_lifetime" value="yes" />
  Validity is lifetime (yellow fever — 2016 IHR amendment)
</label>
<label>Centre stamp image
  <input type="file" name="entry_1_centre_stamp_image" accept="image/*" />
</label>
<label>
  <input type="checkbox" name="entry_1_centre_stamp_applied" value="yes" />
  Official centre stamp applied
</label>
